ECHO ===== BASELINE CLOCK / DATE-TIME =====
DATE
TODAY
TIME
NOW
DATETIME
CALC DATE()
CALC TODAY()
CALC TIME()
CALC NOW()
CALC DATETIME()
CALC (DATE() = TODAY())
CALC (NOW() = DATETIME())

ECHO ===== DATE ALGEBRA / FUNCTION BASELINE =====
CALC DATE() + 2
CALC DATE() - 2
CTOD 2000-01-01
CTOD "2000-01-01"
CTOD "2000/01/01"
CTOD 20000101
CALC CTOD("2000-01-01")
CALC DTOC(CTOD("2000-01-01"))
DATEADD 20000101, 30
DATEADD 20000101, -30
DATEDIFF 20000101, 20000103
CALC DATEADD(DATE(), 30)
CALC DATEDIFF(CTOD("2000-01-01"), DATE())

ECHO ===== RHS EXPRESSION SANITY =====
CALC (3 = 1 + 2)
CALC ((1 + 2) = (6 / 2))
CALC ((1 + 2 * 3) = (1 + (2 * 3)))

ECHO ===== STRING / CHAR COMMANDS =====
ALLTRIM "  hi  "
LTRIM "  hi"
RTRIM "hi  "
TRIM "hi  "
UPPER "aBc"
LOWER "aBc"
PROPER "joHN"
LEN "ABCDE"
LEFT "ABCDE", 3
RIGHT "ABCDE", 2
SUBSTR "ABCDE", 2, 3
AT "CD", "ABCDE"
ATC "cd", "ABCDE"
CHR 65
ASC "A"
SPACE 3
REPLICATE "x", 5
PADC "hi", 6
PADL "hi", 6
PADR "hi", 6
STUFF "ABCDE", 2, 2, "ZZ"
STR 123
VAL "123.45"
TRANSFORM 123
LIKE "SMITH", "SMI%"

ECHO ===== NORMALIZE / MULTIREP / CONCAT / STRCAT =====
